


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_f830ef36:



    voice "2RI_1573"
    rin "「嗯啊啊啊啊啊——！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_90cf8f46:


    "黄昏后的天台响彻着伦的吼叫声。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_c966a521:



    voice "2HI_1560"
    hina "「伦因为浅生能量耗完而开始失控了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_41138bf4:


    "这一整个星期里，文因为要帮家里的忙所以都是从家里到学校两点一线。所以这几天都是在教室见面然后在公交站告别。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_d4ed1052:



    voice "2SA_0866"
    sachiko "「伦你再多忍3天不就得了嘛」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_5e972c5b:



    voice "2RI_1574"
    rin "「明明还有课要上的啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_6b9128aa:



    voice "2SA_0867"
    sachiko "「啊啊，你说那方面吗。其实文应该也拒绝掉了吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_b5bfa0fb:



    voice "2HI_1561"
    hina "「不过浅生她很不擅长推辞呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_27e96a22:



    voice "2RI_1575"
    rin "「嗯嗯嗯嗯嗯嗯！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_ee887b5c:


    "确实因为无法拒绝而使状况变得事与愿违。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_ddcab418:



    voice "2RI_1576"
    rin "「竟然跑来找学生做这个，那群人也太欠缺社会道德了吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_8140b2e6:



    voice "2SA_0868"
    sachiko "「现在一边读书一边从事艺人活动的女生挺多的呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_d3670dd5:



    voice "2RI_1577"
    rin "「不会违反校规么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_b627e4d3:



    voice "2SA_0869"
    sachiko "「圣叶对这方面管得好像还挺松的哦～」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_44ae2c18:



    voice "2RI_1578"
    rin "「我指的不是那方面！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_0c7ef3ed:



    voice "2SA_0870"
    sachiko "「就算跟我说这个也没用啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_9a216a7d:


    "迁怒于人。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_47c4450e:



    voice "2HI_1562"
    hina "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_cc59574d:


    "阳菜盯着闹别扭的伦。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_b99c0c94:



    voice "2RI_1579"
    rin "「什、什么啊？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_7920e00c:



    voice "2HI_1563"
    hina "「你就说出你的真心话吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_23bf528e:



    voice "2RI_1580"
    rin "「什么真心话……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_fdd34334:



    voice "2HI_1564"
    hina "「到头来你只是无论如何都想和浅生一起吧，伦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_c803dddd:


    "被直白地说穿而显得有些畏缩的伦，好一阵子都开不了口，"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_9e1c88d4:



    voice "2RI_1581"
    rin "「我不想她远离我而去啊……！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_5c184079:


    "然后说出了真心话。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_31928dd2:



    voice "2HI_1565"
    hina "「那你去跟她本人说说？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_51271b26:


    "伦摇了摇头。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_a9dd3c9a:



    voice "2RI_1582"
    rin "「我不想被她讨厌啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_1eefd3f5:



    voice "2HI_1566"
    hina "「为什么会被她讨厌？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_12c14857:



    voice "2RI_1583"
    rin "「而且我也不想妨碍她……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_32e5f433:



    voice "2HI_1567"
    hina "「那你干脆放开双手任由她去，怎么样？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_17f70aec:



    voice "2RI_1584"
    rin "「我怎么可能做得到嘛！要是把文的女友这一称谓从我身上夺走了那我还剩下什么啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_c40c7da6:



    voice "2HI_1568"
    hina "「前女友吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_c42b883e:



    voice "2RI_1585"
    rin "「呜哇啊啊啊啊啊！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_96382334:



    voice "2HI_1569"
    hina "「那你再去安个什么称谓不就得了嘛。那样就能填补上了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_4f3829fe:



    voice "2RI_1586"
    rin "「但是……我什么都没有了啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_cb94182c:



    voice "2HI_1570"
    hina "「唉。你就是指望着好事都是落在你身上了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_0cb20fc5:


    "阳菜叹了口气。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_d85d3de5:



    voice "2HI_1571"
    hina "「估计你是认为你自己废柴的地方浅生她也一样会喜欢的对吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_fa5b7583:



    voice "2RI_1587"
    rin "「呜……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_13a14e4d:


    "彻底无言以对了。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_ad3bc2c0:



    voice "2SA_0871"
    sachiko "「阳菜。别单刀直入地把伦逼得那么紧啊。她很容易短路的」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_09ff8e9a:



    voice "2HI_1572"
    hina "「因为依赖对方而把对方关进了自己的世界。简要点说的话，就是碍事」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_e1f9522c:



    voice "2SA_0872"
    sachiko "「……我怎么觉得这两人都半斤八两的呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_49ecc75a:



    voice "2HI_1573"
    hina "「太过于依赖对方的话只要稍微打破了一点平衡那两人间的关系就会变得很奇怪哦？正好也是个机会了，试着自己独立一下吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_bd7c18a1:



    voice "2RI_1588"
    rin "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_cf5f71d2:


    "只是一味索取的话，是无法让两人间的关系成立的。"




translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_f73bd9d8:


    "这一整个星期里，文因为要帮家里的忙所以都是从家里到学校两点一线。所以这几天都是在教室见面然后在公交站告别。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_8309578f:


    voice "2RI_1577"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_2d0bb69b:


    rin "「不会违反校规么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_93f95130:


    voice "2SA_0869"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_04_d767b31c:


    sachiko "「圣叶对这方面管得好像还挺松的哦～」"
